  "about": "[проверить] 26.1.2 follow-up: ordinary fractional falls distinguish the rounding inferred from fall-mode-teleport-motion and pvp-mace-landing-motion from smash-only protection. Heights 3.5, 3.999, 4, 4.001, 4.5, 5.5. Exact outgoing movement and velocity; expected unarmored damage under the inferred rule: 0,0,1,1,1,2. Verify integer boundaries, no fixed landing delay. Stone pad is removed in cleanup.",
